     1348              out-vatp_doc-line.doc-code   = buf_trn-doc.doc-code
     1349          and out-vatp_doc-line.artic      = buf_doc-line.artic
     1350          and out-vatp_doc-line.prod-type  = buf_doc-line.prod-type
     1351          and out-vatp_doc-line.prod-code  = buf_doc-line.prod-code no-lock no-error.
     1352   if available out-vatp_doc-line           and
