     4010           str-find = 'es':U
     4011           str-find1 = 'rs':U
     4012         .
     4013       else
     4014         assign
     4015           str-find = 'ee':U
     4016           str-find1 = 're':U
     4017         .
     4018       for each temp-goods-cli :
